    "reviews": [
      {
        "author_name": "Olivier",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/104861278496921041767/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjU55Gm9TcnWMEh7lyjUFrA-CVc4nBPGjEylzxazyDS9KxLwgTg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "3 weeks ago",
        "text": "The employee Jabs is one of the cutest human beings I’ve ever encountered, despite is awful physique. His magnificent presence and twig attitude actually cured my body dismorphia. Why go to therapy when there’s Buzzfit Vaudreuil? Ten out of ten must try again.",
        "time": 1769105997,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "John Locke",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/105338901379965878972/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWWJMuD-C3Iy62xkGYlqXpA5pBZHiR7tQeaPyYD-QEf8GFy0Y0X=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3",
        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "11 months ago",
        "text": "Gym is a little small and prices aren't really as good as some people were telling me for what you get.. It does have everything you need to workout and the great part is that it is 24/7.\n\nIt could just be me but the air literally hurts my nose. As if it is extremely dry or dusty, not sure. The water comes out kind of warm and tastes a little funky. But it's fine to drink.\n\nUnfortunately, when someone takes a poo in the men's restroom, it REALLY stinks the whole room up. The smell seems to stay for a long time too.. It's also a pretty small locker room so \"moon landings\" are pretty common while you try to hold your breath and hurry out.\n\nOverall it's alright. 24/7 being the best part. Employees are chill.\n\nEDIT: The gym keeps getting worse. The dumbbells are all busted, the equipment is often broken or wonky. The employees at night workout with their buddies and leave their stuff all over the place. I can hear them yelling \"BRO!!! BROOO!!\" from across the gym (with noise cancelling earbuds). Some dudes were play wrestling next to two women trying to workout in peace. It really sucks to have to deal with when you pay for a membership. Employees should be working to help the clients... Instead they workout and leave the gym a mess.",
        "time": 1740490523,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "plst",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/113985479517679418659/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJ8rXyNLjGbcT7Dq7KEeeeMGizN_kxtiyaCkmR5gVRNpLRt9g=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "2 months ago",
        "text": "staff are extremely rude. idk who they think they are but with that attitude they must think they’re working some type of doctor salary job. very bad experience i canceled my subscription there and never went back",
        "time": 1764492258,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "rob",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/104846514353594765361/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocK8NqEJgTxWszb7B0gPE0Mv0UTynHC4c-RmTixBFBUdISjZhQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3",
        "rating": 2,
        "relative_time_description": "5 months ago",
        "text": "Its too full, always people asking me whrn im done with the machienes, its annoying, iprefer other gyms, less crowded",
        "time": 1757221453,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Lucky",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/104748105020999709549/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWL9EloDWopcrtY6-eKTsOjGK91wgBcDTAe7LTDRDf4Fzmrs_-E=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2",
        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "11 months ago",
        "text": "Trying to cancel my membership left a very sour taste. Emails, calling, showing up in person, nothing seemed to work after weeks of waiting. Ended up having to involve my bank to sort it out for me and thankfully they took less than 10 minutes to help.\n\nEdit: Kinda funny, kinda sad, but they left a response to this with the ChatGPT prompt untouched. The attention to detail of management never fails to impress",
        "time": 1742401640,
        "translated": false
      }
